<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-9737] Ignite WatchDog service should be configurable</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-9737</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;At the moment, there is no way to disable Ignite WatchDog service from config or JVM option.&lt;br/&gt;
In any corner case or bug in that feature Ignite can become fully unusable due to unpredictable shutdown.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;We should provide a way to enable/disable this feature from config or from JVM option.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment></environment>
        <key id="13188117">IGNITE-9737</key>
            <summary>Ignite WatchDog service should be configurable</summary>
